{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft your dream railway line in locomotive sandbox Islands and Trains. From pootling past a seaside village to winding a track through wintery forests, this little story is yours to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1957760/extras/steampage_clip1.gif?t=1748556146\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design a train route around the island of your dreams and watch your diorama come to life. Go off the beaten track, winding around mountains and crossing lakes.\u00a0 Place animals and edit the surrounding countryside to your liking. There\u2019s no goals, no timers, no missions, and no mistakes - just happy accidents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1957760/extras/steampage_clip2.gif?t=1748556146\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>We were inspired by beloved games such as Islanders, Dorfromantik and Townscaper.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Good Shepherd","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1957760/f93c322a7f10a5abb4f26158bd133c5c6201519f.jpg"},{"name":"Grand Admiral","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1957760/f93c322a7f10a5abb4f26158bd133c5c6201519f.jpg"},{"name":"Forester","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1957760/f93c322a7f10a5abb4f26158bd133c5c6201519f.jpg"},{"name":"Lumberjack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1957760/f93c322a7f10a5abb4f26158bd133c5c6201519f.jpg"},{"name":"Town builder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1957760/f93c322a7f10a5abb4f26158bd133c5c6201519f.jpg"},{"name":"Farmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunit